From c90b995da6d890c35044b0bfd6c2fac653c292f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:00:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] test: api_daemon re-boots only on
 api_server_port_in_use; listener timeout carries restart.log

A non-port api_server fatal (e.g. api_server_key_invalid) used to boot five
times and then report 'never owned a free port'. api_listener_state now
returns the settled record, api_daemon retries only the free-port race and
fails at once with the real error code and the daemon's restart.log, and the
listener-settle timeout carries restart.log like daemon()'s ready assert.

Follow-up to review 5879571299 on #1656.
